Title: What They Called Recovery
Credit: Animated feature screenplay — individual review draft
Author: Christopher Kokkinos
Draft date: 2026-09-28
Status: Individual scene draft; whole-film pass provisionally accepted, individual author review pending

INT. NEW LODGING/HELEN AND BRIAN'S HOUSE - EVENING

P06-11803: an application, a break, Mac's later contact, a reopened file. Zoe separates these dates. The coded payments and monitoring entries include Brian and a joint account, but none is labelled a price for a child. She sees questions about attachment and outside contact.

At home Helen stops herself from calling the familiar number. Brian still wants certainty Mac says he can provide. Their fear for Zoe does not settle what they knew years ago.

Zoe finds indications she may have been shown to them before placement. Anger rises; she does not open every image.

ZOE
Mac found a door into it. That doesn't mean he owned the whole building.

Elias brings food and waits while she closes the file and writes down only what she can support.
